CC0 1.0 Universal — Public Domain Dedication

The exercise data in this folder (exwb/curated/*.json) is transcribed from public-domain
books: A. B. Davidson, An Introductory Hebrew Grammar, 22nd edition, revised by J. E. McFadyen
(Edinburgh: T. & T. Clark, 1923), J. E. McFadyen, Key to the Exercises (1924), and J. Gresham
Machen, New Testament Greek for Beginners (New York: Macmillan, 1923). The Davidson answers come from
McFadyen's Key; the Machen answers were written for this project. Hints, explanations, answers and
corrections added here are part of the dedication. No MorphGNT or SBLGNT data is included in this folder.

To the extent possible under law, the author(s) have waived all copyright and related or
neighboring rights to this data, including the added hints and explanations, worldwide.
It is distributed without any warranty.

